# Ensign  

  

## Overview  

  

Ensign is the entry-level commissioned officer rank within Eagle Fleet. Officers holding this rank have graduated from Starfleet Academy and received their first assignment aboard a starship, starbase, or Fleet installation.  

  

Ensigns are expected to apply their training in practical situations, develop professional expertise, and begin building the leadership skills required for advancement through the officer ranks.  

  

## Rank Information  

  

| Category | Value |  

|----------|--------|  

| Rank | Ensign |  

| Abbreviation | ENS |  

| Grade | Junior Officer |  

| Superior Rank | [[10 Lieutenant Junior Grade]] |  

| Junior Rank | None |  

| Typical Posting | Junior Officer, Division Officer, Department Staff |  

  

## Responsibilities  

  

- Carrying out assigned duties and responsibilities  

- Supporting departmental operations  

- Learning shipboard and fleet procedures  

- Assisting senior officers in mission execution  

- Leading small teams when required  

- Developing professional and leadership skills  

  

## Authority  

  

An Ensign is a commissioned officer and holds authority over enlisted personnel when assigned to a supervisory role. Ensigns are expected to follow the guidance of senior officers while demonstrating initiative and professionalism.  

  

## Typical Assignments  

  

- Junior Engineering Officer  

- Junior Operations Officer  

- Junior Science Officer  

- Junior Security Officer  

- Junior Medical Officer  

- Flight Control Officer  

- Communications Officer  

- Administrative Officer  

  

